//! Stubs for `packages/pyright-internal/src/analyzer/tuples.ts`, generated by tools/stubgen.
//! Every body is `todo!()`. Port each one from the TypeScript at its marker.
//! Evaluator code: allocate with `P::new_eval` (docs/porting.md, "memory").

